# Dataset

The dataset used in this project is available on Kaggle.

**Dataset Name:** Health Care: Heart Attack Possibility

**Source:** Kaggle

**Dataset Link:**  
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nareshbhat/health-care-data-set-on-heart-attack-possibility

## Instructions

1. Open the Kaggle dataset link.
2. Download the dataset.
3. Extract the CSV file if it is downloaded in a ZIP folder.
4. Upload the CSV file to your Google Colab environment.
5. Update the dataset path in the notebook if required.
